     1	"""v4 development gate (docs/PREREG_v4.md), computed from raw AndroidWorld episodes + offline dev metrics.
     2	
     3	Gate (all must hold to freeze v4 and run it on sealed held-out seeds):
     4	  (1) dev_answer: "clearly above 0" := answer match (v4_answer_check.gate_answer: same_answer and no added content words) >= 0.20, and `answer`
     5	      emitted on >= 50% of rows;
     6	  (2) dev_complete: `answer` on <= 3% of action-goal final rows;
     7	  (3) AndroidWorld seed 30: >= 3 answer-task successes AND action-task successes >= v3's - 3.
     8	usage: python scripts/v4_gate.py --v4 results/androidworld/lfm3vl2b_v4 --v3 results/androidworld/lfm3vl2b_v3 \
     9	         --v4_agent lfm3vl2b_v4_q4km --dev_answer <lfm3_v4_dev_answer.jsonl> --dev_complete <lfm3_v4_dev_complete.jsonl>
    10	Input integrity: one run dir per arm, the same 116 tasks with identical goal text + instance seed as the v3 seed-30 run,
    11	agent_name checked; dev predictions must cover exactly the pinned dev splits (results/v4_dev_reference.json) from the
    12	expected model.
    13	"""
    14	import argparse
    15	import glob
    16	import gzip
    17	import json
    18	import math
    19	import os
    20	import pickle
    21	import re
    22	import sys
