     7	                         (euclidean distance in normalized [0,1] coords) of GT point
     8	      input_text/answer: normalized exact match OR token-F1 >= 0.5
     9	      scroll           : same direction
    10	      open_app         : case-insensitive equal / containment
    11	      others           : type match suffices
    12	  episode_sr : all steps of an episode correct (offline task completion proxy)
